  "ingredients": [
    "6 cups water",
    "1 (3 pound) whole chicken",
    "1 medium onion, chopped",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "0.5 pound smoked sausage of your choice, sliced",
    "1 cup long-grain white rice",
    "2 tablespoons Italian-style seasoning",
    "2 cubes chicken bouillon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0hiwQNNpIcn8mkJpQjthCeVcMjQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9057-chicken-bog-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-gw-0928-b434fc8ecace4d9e80a37e83e50194ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9057/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water, chicken, onion, and salt to a boil in a large pot over medium heat. Reduce the heat, cover, and simmer until chicken is no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, about 1 hour. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh, near the bone, should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/73pJOlue4f-PTqiv_xI4qYwfK4c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9057-chicken-bog-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-gw-0942-fc8719043b14430d85ddf506a37ba079.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9057/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer chicken to a cutting board to cool for 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ov9ht0tbhMYOB_2xCtAYrvteUFU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9057-chicken-bog-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-gw-0948-bda54b2f68de4ee4a4ec3a1bdbcdb5ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9057/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Skim and discard fat from cooking liquid. Measure 3 ½ cups of cooking liquid and pour into a 6-quart saucepan. Discard remaining cooking liquid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OpFvSrqpNId1TXWlGkyc5J2UFSE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9057-chicken-bog-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-gw-0950-363f277ded4c47cf9bfa66f4bf9ab933.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9057/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove and discard chicken skin and bones. Chop meat into bite-sized pieces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZOoT9RHNy753QrLbHawRpnI_GUk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9057-chicken-bog-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-gw-0955-343b492b3a734f16a16e6c00eea33f69.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9057/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add chicken to the cooking liquid in the saucepan. Add sausage, rice, Italian seasoning, and bouillon. Set over medium-low heat and cook for 30 minutes. Reduce the heat to low, cover, and cook, stirring often, until thickened to desired consistency, 10 to 20 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DM7koV15xtubp0wT0JbMZk0-KNs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9057-chicken-bog-ddmfs-4x3-step-09-gw-0997-ec01a2c982984373876cac3314e12215.jpg"
      ],
